  "label": "Deportation Policy",
  "description": "A policy or legal process by which a government removes a person from its territory, typically for immigration violations. The meme references the idea of 'sending illegals to our sanctuary city,' which implies a contradiction in deportation policy — that sanctuary cities are somehow 'avoiding' responsibility for deporting undocumented individuals. This requires background knowledge of U.S. immigration enforcement and the legal framework surrounding deportation.",
